1
00:00:00,593 --> 00:00:02,093
(Sheldon:)Oh, you think you're so clever.

2
00:00:02,261 --> 00:00:05,641
(Sheldon:)Well, let me just tell you.
While I do not currently have a retort...

3
00:00:05,806 --> 00:00:08,766
(Sheldon:)...check your e-mail periodically
for a doozy.

4
00:00:13,522 --> 00:00:16,022
(Leonard:)So much for our friendship with Sheldon.

5
00:00:16,192 --> 00:00:19,862
(Raj:)Well, we'll always have the night
the heat went out.

6
00:00:28,537 --> 00:00:29,577
(Raj:)-Hi.
-Hey.

7
00:00:29,747 --> 00:00:33,497
Since we got interrupted last night,
I didn't have a chance to give you this.

8
00:00:33,918 --> 00:00:37,088
Aw, Leonard. You shouldn't have.

9
00:00:38,547 --> 00:00:39,837
Oh, boy. Ha, ha.

10
00:00:41,717 --> 00:00:43,137
(Penny:)What is it?

11
00:00:43,677 --> 00:00:46,517
(Leonard:)It's a snowflake from the North Pole.

12
00:00:47,723 --> 00:00:49,853
(Penny:)-Are you serious?
-Uh-huh.

13
00:00:50,017 --> 00:00:54,857
(Leonard:)It'll last forever. I preserved it in a
1 -percent solution of polyvinyl acetal resin.

14
00:00:58,567 --> 00:01:01,607
(Penny:)God, that's the most romantic thing
anyone's ever said to me...

